  "description": "On the road again… The perfect blend of agility and comfort, our Falco Sport is equally at home with a short commute as it is with long endurance rides. If you’re looking for something versatile to suit your road and more needs, then we’ve got you covered.\nThe wide gear and 50/34 Compact FSA crankset mixed with the wide gears (11-32T) mean the Reid Falco Sport road bike is at home in the mountains.\nThe double-butted 6061 alloy frame with hydroformed tubing and internal cable routing is lightweight, with a balance of vertical compliance and lateral stiffness for excellent on-road handling. With the Reid Falco Sport road bike, the carbon fibre fork lowers weight and further reduces road buzz.\nThe Shimano Tiagra 4700 20-speed gearing is a solid performer that put simply, gets the job done on the Reid Falco Sport. As Shimano trickles the technology down, the 4700 uses very similar technology to the higher level 105.",
